      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To directly address fatigue concerns, the new rotations integrate mandatory, strategic micro-breaks built into high-activity cycles, preventing prolonged periods of stagnation. Furthermore, the sequencing of shifts is calculated to ensure regulatory compliance with HOS limits, guaranteeing sufficient rest periods between long hauls. These timings leverage predictive modeling to balance workload demands against physiological recovery needs, thereby proactively mitigating fatigue risk. This optimized structure confirms maximum efficiency without compromising the highest standards of driver safety.",
      "source": "target",
